== Trivia ==
* Despite being present as backing vocals and singing some lines with Ichika and Miku (most notably Don't Stop Don't Stop), {{ColorLink|Saki}} is not credited as a vocalist in this song.
* Yoshioka Mayu ({{ColorLink|Haruka}}'s VA) and Honnizumi Rina ({{ColorLink|Shizuku}}'s VA) also performed a duet cover of this song on their shared [https://youtu.be/3OaO7cFpA9Y?si=p85TLFUQQADXh2OB YouTube channel].

