'''Journey''' is a [[song]] by [[DECO*27]] and arranged by [[Rockwell]] featuring {{ColorLink|miku}} alongside {{ColorLink|ichika}}, {{ColorLink|minori}}, {{ColorLink|kohane}}, {{ColorLink|tsukasa}}, and {{ColorLink|kanade}}. This song was commissioned to celebrate the second anniversary of the [[Project SEKAI COLORFUL STAGE!|game]] and became playable on September 30th, 2022. Players can unlock this song for free by claiming it in the [[Present Box]].

The full-length version of the SEKAI cover was first uploaded to the [https://www.youtube.com/@pj_sekai_colorfulstage official YouTube channel] with a 2DMV on September 30th. It was also released on the [[Journey (single)|Journey]] single on November 1st, 2022.

